  Keys  /keys                                                        Esc returns
 › Enter           send                 Send a prompt, or a steering message
                                        during a turn
   Shift+Enter,    line_break           Insert a line break
   Ctrl+J
   Esc             close_or_interrupt   Close what is on top; interrupt the turn
                                        when nothing is open
   Ctrl+C          clear_then_quit      Clear the draft, then quit
   ⌥0              go_home              Go home
   Ctrl+N          new_session          Start a new session
   ⌥1 ⌥2 ⌥3 ⌥4 ⌥5  rail_row_n           Switch to the session of rail card N
⋮  ⌥6 ⌥7 ⌥8 ⌥9
⋮  Delete,         delete_session       Delete the selected exited, or a live
⋮  Backspace                            one with Delete session in the session
                                        list
   ↑               recall_prompt        Recall an earlier prompt from the
                                        project of the session on screen
   ←               focus_rail           Move focus from an empty input box into
                                        the rail
 Ctrl+O is bound to Open or close the ledgers
 Enter swap · Esc cancel
